  "analysis": "Now I understand the structure from SKILL.md. The data files are stored in `$WORKSPACE/memory/clawdbot-sync/`:\n- peers.json - Configured peers\n- history.json - Sync history log\n- config.json - Sync preferences\n- conflicts/ - Conflicting files for review\n\nThe task requires:\n1. Add office-peer (100.64.12.34, clawdbot, /home/clawdbot/clawd) to peers.json\n2. Record a pending sync entry in history.json\n3. Update config.json to include this peer in bi-directional sync\n\nI need NOT touch identity files or instance-specific config.",
